        "original_id": "a277d6a6-d46a-5963-be09-418ce8451061",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Crystal Palace F.C., Ivory Coast national team\n- Awards: Crystal Palace F.C. Player of the Year\n- People: John McCormick, Wilfried Zaha\n- Roles: winger, professional footballer\n\nFacts:\n- The Crystal Palace F.C. Player of the Year award is presented at the end of each season.\n- In 1972, John McCormick became the inaugural winner of the Crystal Palace F.C. Player of the Year award.\n- Since 1972, 34 different players have won the Crystal Palace F.C. Player of the Year award.\n- Nine players have won the Crystal Palace F.C. Player of the Year award twice, with Wilfried Zaha being the most recent repeat winner.\n- Wilfried Zaha, born on 10 November 1992, is a professional footballer who plays as a winger for Crystal Palace and the Ivory Coast national team.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
